catflow 0.8; events
1. On File            memos/; pattern=*.m4a; settle=30s
2. Read Audio
3. Transcribe         Whisper Tiny; lang=en
4. Gate               Ministral 3B; "Garbled or truncated? tags: bad, ok"
   -> { bad: 5 | ok: 6 }
5. Transcribe   (2)   Whisper Large v3; lang=en
6. Summarize          Qwen3 8B; "3 bullets, then action items"
7. Save Text          memos/{name}-notes.md
